    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Iced Latte is a story-driven <strong>visual novel</strong> inspired by <strong>romantic comedy anime</strong>. The game includes a <strong>streamer-friendly safe mode</strong>. Run your caf\u00e9 in a <strong>barista simulator</strong> and build relationships with your co-workers in a lighthearted <strong>dating sim</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One very hot day, Katsuki-kun walks into an inconspicuous coffee shop called Milk Milk Coffee. There he meets the charming busty barista Moka-chan. Having fallen in love with her at first sight, out of excitement he asks for coffee with... breast milk. After this, his life will completely change!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew a lot of coffee!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with drinks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with beautiful baristas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the popularity of the coffee shop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/5da634e0f6bfff05e92ea86d81e89c14.avif?t=1754315514\" width=600 height=746 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/acb0e02e04aee48acc1c4b222d2491e6.avif?t=1754315514\" width=600 height=746 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/6afc9a60d042a376ffd9eab1cd58cc7f.avif?t=1754315514\" width=600 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300c\u30ad\u30df\u306e\u30d6\u30ec\u30b9\u30c8\u30df\u30eb\u30af\u306e\u30a2\u30a4\u30b9\u30e9\u30c6\u3092\u4e00\u3064\u4e0b\u3055\u3044!\u300d 2025 EX-LIZZARD DEVS</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Iced Latte is a story-driven <strong>visual novel</strong> inspired by <strong>romantic comedy anime</strong>. The game includes a <strong>streamer-friendly safe mode</strong>. Run your caf\u00e9 in a <strong>barista simulator</strong> and build relationships with your co-workers in a lighthearted <strong>dating sim</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One very hot day, Katsuki-kun walks into an inconspicuous coffee shop called Milk Milk Coffee. There he meets the charming busty barista Moka-chan. Having fallen in love with her at first sight, out of excitement he asks for coffee with... breast milk. After this, his life will completely change!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew a lot of coffee!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with drinks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with beautiful baristas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the popularity of the coffee shop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/5da634e0f6bfff05e92ea86d81e89c14.avif?t=1754315514\" width=600 height=746 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/acb0e02e04aee48acc1c4b222d2491e6.avif?t=1754315514\" width=600 height=746 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/6afc9a60d042a376ffd9eab1cd58cc7f.avif?t=1754315514\" width=600 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300c\u30ad\u30df\u306e\u30d6\u30ec\u30b9\u30c8\u30df\u30eb\u30af\u306e\u30a2\u30a4\u30b9\u30e9\u30c6\u3092\u4e00\u3064\u4e0b\u3055\u3044!\u300d 2025 EX-LIZZARD DEVS</p>",
